4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AcmJW3waa2QQ7kNvwHX9QIi&_nc_oc=AdpUAhx2ZDPmLvm8hNxzWbZDUjZUTBvAUoBzEar3cYnEZ0y_IgzbOjWClU6kafHc_WA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFpVwN1roMuwXCNwrDUPOC7TcbcPDXs1gv55bYAomOh0A&oe=6A942A54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KqReJSqekzoQ7kNvwEP3cLS&_nc_oc=Adr8xX9eKR4oQKi3zjbDMStRP6BeHAoZqoA2mFIOet2xWwqNbQaHRVo_qHgP6jx0FNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG7OY7EcEkuF5rgqm79-iNF0pFkuTJ-TDWTtMai6189Cw&oe=6A942F32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xAviPjI91eUQ7kNvwElR0Po&_nc_oc=AdqwlZFO6hPvQ4gTEUqaa--EPgsVbLke-7lwZtwxNULj8vloCKq5-LHsMwkq-H43Kb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEeT_mqpmEsfF9yccy314jUKCtOnfHyG0Z-xvvLP_u79A&oe=6A940495"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p